亂，史稱「雪夜下蔡州」。封涼國公、鳳翔節度使。","link_td_id":"Q10008375","link_td_number_id":227273,"people_name":"李愬","people_name_jianti_auto":"李愬","people_xingming":"李愬","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"c34021ee-db0e-11ef-8d61-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"武寧","place_name_jianti_auto":"武宁","place_note":"总部设徐州【江苏省徐州市】","resolved_place_entity_id":488,"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"c34021ef-db0e-11ef-9a66-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魚臺","place_name_jianti_auto":"鱼台","place_note":"山东省鱼台县","resolved_place_entity_id":5542,"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"c34021f0-db0e-11ef-8346-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、兖州府（卷三十二）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"十四年，愬攻李师道，自金乡进至鱼台，是也。《志》云：鱼台...","context_before":"...鱼台县。元和四年，淄青帅李师道请移县于黄台市，即今县治。","source_end_index":176,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"b9a4a8ca-5ded-5449-a6c2-021ffdf975fd","source_start_index":145,"source_text":"九年，武宁节度使李愬奉诏讨师道，遣将李祐败贼于鱼台，进取金乡。"},{"context_after":"《志》云：鱼台县故城在今县东北五十里。今城北旧有小城，即...","context_before":"...武宁节度使李愬奉诏讨师道，遣将李祐败贼于鱼台，进取金乡。","source_end_index":197,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"b9a4a8ca-5ded-5449-a6c2-021ffdf975fd","source_start_index":176,"source_text":"十四年，愬攻李师道，自金乡进至鱼台，是也。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/二、兖州府（卷三十二）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"3壬辰，武寧節度使李愬拔魚臺。","content_fanyi":"壬辰日，武宁节度使李愬攻克鱼台。","content_jianti_auto":"3壬辰，武宁节度使李愬拔鱼台。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":24347,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"c34021de-db0e-11ef-b5c3-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"京師","place_name_jianti_auto":"京师","resolved_place_entity_id":43,"star