厚云然。此文人人能诵，然今之好为谀者，固自若也。予...","context_before":"...，又宜得周、孔千百。何吾生胸中扰扰焉多周、孔哉？”是时，","source_end_index":180,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"46e22fe0-7efb-4ceb-a02d-935b67bc62a3","source_start_index":169,"source_text":"刘梦得在连，韩退之在潮"}],"path":"四笔/卷九/誉人过实","source_name":"容斋随笔"},{"display_title":"容斋随笔/韩公潮州表","excerpts":[{"context_after":"。而谢表云：“臣于当时之文，未有过人者。至论陛下功德，与...","context_before":"...，至云：“凡有殃咎，宜加臣身，上天监临，臣不怨悔。”坐此","source_end_index":47,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"73d3ea8d-00bc-4efd-9dc6-761f17c0bd99","source_start_index":42,"source_text":"贬潮州刺史"}],"path":"五笔/卷九/韩公潮州表","source_name":"容斋随笔"}],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"上得表，大怒，出示宰相，將加愈極刑。裴度、崔羣爲言：「愈雖狂，發於忠懇，宜寬容以開言路。」癸巳，貶愈爲潮州刺史。","content_fanyi":"皇帝看到奏表，大为恼怒，把表拿给宰相们看，准备将韩愈处以极刑。裴度、崔群替他进言说：“韩愈虽然狂妄，但出于忠诚恳切，应当宽赦他，以打开进言之路。”癸巳日，朝廷将韩愈贬为潮州刺史。","content_jianti_auto":"上得表，大怒，出示宰相，将加愈极刑。裴度、崔群为言：「愈虽狂，发于忠恳，宜宽容以开言路。」癸巳，贬愈为潮州刺史。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":24350,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"c3426b63-db0e-11ef-ad46-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"釋氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"释氏","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"c3426b70-db0e-11ef-a580-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"難，乃旦翻。釋氏之說，談空以難有。","note_content_jianti_auto":"难，乃旦翻。释氏之说，谈空以难有。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"c3426b6f-db0e-11ef-951f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"原其所自，則聖人之所以垂世立敎者也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"原其所自，则圣人之所以垂世立教者也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":181,"tongjian_id":"c3426b72-db0e-11ef-99fb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-571,"link_death_year":-471,"link_td_description":"老子，春秋时期思想家，道家及道教的奠基者，著有《道德经》。","link_td_id":"Q10000007","link_td_number_id":2195,"people_name":"老","people_name_jianti_auto":"老","people_xingming":"老子","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"c3426b73-db0e-11ef-a130-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-369,"link_death_year":-286,"link_td_description":"庄子，庄氏，名周，一说字子休，约与孟子同时，宋国蒙人，曾任漆园吏。为中国战国中期思想家、哲学家、文学家，是道家学派的代表人物，老子思想的继承和发展者，后世将他与老子并称为“老庄”。","link_td_id":"Q10000070","link_td_number_id":2168,"people_name":"莊","people_name_jianti_auto":"庄","people_xingming":"庄子","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"c3426b74-db0e-11ef-a1c3-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":768,"link_death_year":824,"link_td_description":"韩愈，字退之，河南府河阳县（今河南省孟州市）人，自称郡望昌黎，世称韩昌黎；晚年任吏部侍郎，又称韩吏部。唐朝官员、文学家，与柳宗元是当时古文运动的推行者，合称“韩柳”。散文、诗，均有名。谥号“文”，世称韩文公。著作收录《昌黎先生集》。","link_td_id":"Q10000028","link_td_number_id":16413,"people_name":"愈","people_name_jianti_auto":"愈","people_xingming":"韩愈","start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"c3426b79-db0e-11ef-9e11-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"文暢","people_name_jianti_auto":"文畅","people_xingming":"文畅","start_index":151,"tongjian_id":"c3426b7a-db0e-11ef-a18a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"戰國","place_name_jianti_auto":"战国","resolved_place_entity_id":1860,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"c3426b75-db0e-11ef-bffc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","resolved_place_entity_id":9,"start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"c3426b76-db0e-11ef-8556-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","resolved_place_entity_id":111,"start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"c3426b77-db0e-11ef-a919-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"宋","place_name_jianti_auto":"宋","resolved_place_entity_id":355,"start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"c3426b78-db0e-11ef-9257-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["史论"],"content":"自戰國之世，老、莊與儒者爭衡，更相是非。至漢未，益之以佛，然好者尚寡。晉、宋以來，日益繁熾，自帝王至于士民，莫不尊信。下者畏慕罪福，高者論難空有。獨愈惡其蠹財惑衆，力排之，其言多矯激太過。惟送文暢師序最得其要，曰：「夫鳥俛而啄，仰而四顧，獸深居而簡出，懼物之爲己害也，猶且不免焉。弱之肉，強之食。今吾與文暢安居而暇食，優游以生死，與禽獸異者，寧可不知其所自邪！」","content_fanyi":"自战国时代以来，老子、庄子与儒家争衡较量，互相论辩是非。到了东汉末年，又加入了佛教，不过喜好的人还不多。晋、宋以来，佛教日益兴旺炽盛，从帝王到士人百姓，无不尊奉信仰。下等的人畏惧罪罚、仰慕福报，上等的人则辩难空、有之理。唯独韩愈厌恶佛教耗费钱财、迷惑民众，大力排斥它，他的言论大多过分偏激。只有他的《送文畅师序》最得要领，文中说：“大凡鸟儿低头啄食，抬头向四周张望，野兽深居而很少外出，是害怕别的动物危害自己，尚且不能避免。弱者的肉，就是强者的食物。如今我和文畅安居而能从容饮食，悠闲自得地安度生死，这种与禽兽不同的生活，难道能够不知道它的由来吗！”","content_jianti_auto":"自战国之世，老、庄与儒者争衡，更相是非。至汉未，益之以佛，然好者尚寡。晋、宋以来，日益繁炽，自帝王至于士民，莫不尊信。下者畏慕罪福，高者论难空有。独愈恶其蠹财惑众，力排之，其言多矫激太过。惟送文畅师序最得其要，曰：「夫鸟俛而啄，仰而四顾，兽深居而简出，惧物之为己害也，犹且不免焉。弱之肉，强之食。今吾与文畅安居而暇食，优游以生死，与禽兽异者，宁可不知其所自邪！」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":24351,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"c3426b6c-db0e-11ef-acd0-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"東阿","place_name_jianti_auto":"东阿","place_note":"山东省阳谷县东北阿城镇","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"c3426b7e-db0e-11ef-84bd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"c3426b7f-db0e-11ef-8f70-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"c3426b80-db0e-11ef-b966-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄆州","place_name_jianti_auto":"郓州","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"c3426b81-db0e-11ef-a0d3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"敗，蒲邁翻。東阿，漢古縣，唐屬鄆州。九域志：在州西北六十里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"败，蒲迈翻。东阿，汉古县，唐属郓州。九域志：在州西北六十里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"c3426b7d-db0e-11ef-b91b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":764,"link_death_year":821,"link_td_description":"田弘正，本名田兴，字安道，唐宪宗赐名弘正。唐平州卢龙（今河北卢龙）人。魏博节度使田承嗣的从侄，相州刺史田廷玠之子。唐宪宗时为魏博节度使，唐穆宗时以功高，升中书令。后改任成德节度使，被成德军兵马使王廷凑谋杀。赠太尉，谥忠愍。","link_td_id":"Q10001745","link_td_number_id":794539,"people_name":"田弘正","people_name_jianti_auto":"田弘正","people_xingming":"田弘正","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"c3426b83-db0e-11ef-9139-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"淄青","place_name_jianti_auto":"淄青","resolved_place_entity_id":778,"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"c3426b84-db0e-11ef-8626-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東阿","place_name_jianti_auto":"东阿","place_note":"山东省阳谷县东北阿城镇","resolved_place_entity_id":1567,"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"c3426b85-db0e-11ef-8926-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/三、济宁州（卷三十三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"宋开宝八年，徙县治南穀镇。太平兴国二年，徙治利仁镇。绍兴...","context_before":"...阿县。元和二年，幸东阿。是也。隋、唐县皆治此。《唐史》：","source_end_index":234,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"bb403b0a-f384-50e4-9106-4dee85247b9a","source_start_index":202,"source_text":"元和十三年，魏博帅田弘正奉诏讨淄青，败其兵于东阿，又败之于阳穀。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/三、济宁州（卷三十三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"5丙申，田弘正奏敗淄青兵於東阿，殺萬餘人。","content_fanyi":"丙申日，田弘正奏报，在东阿击败淄青军队，斩杀一万余人。","content_jianti_auto":"5丙申，田弘正奏败淄青兵于东阿，杀万余人。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":24352,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"c3426b7c-db0e-11ef-83a1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"程權","people_name_jianti_auto":"程权","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c