中，郑权作为横海节度使与沧州刺史李宗奭发生矛盾，上奏朝廷，导致后续事件。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"橫海節度使鄭權","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"be93058f-fef4-4927-9162-85631c064ed2"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢近臣","official_name":"中使","official_note":"中使是唐代皇帝派遣的宦官使者，负责传达诏令或执行特殊任务。在上下文中，皇帝派遣中使追捕李宗奭，以处理其与郑权的冲突。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"上遣中使追之","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"4211c956-dc37-4725-981d-804c824c9ab3"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"烏重胤","official_note":"乌重胤是唐代将领，在上下文中被任命为横海节度使以替代郑权，这反映了朝廷对地方军事官员的调整。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"詔以烏重胤代權","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"ef72c08e-3be0-4b32-ba9e-4d4171982bfa"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"李宗奭","people_name_jianti_auto":"李宗奭","people_xingming":"李宗奭","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"c3426b90-db0e-11ef-a5e1-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":824,"link_td_description":"郑权，字复道，荥阳开封人，唐朝中期的节度使。","link_td_id":"Q10017049","link_td_number_id":4544704,"people_name":"鄭權","people_name_jianti_auto":"郑权","people_xingming":"郑权","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"c3426b91-db0e-11ef-8a02-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":824,"link_td_description":"郑权，字复道，荥阳开封人，唐朝中期的节度使。","link_td_id":"Q10017049","link_td_number_id":4544704,"people_name":"權","people_name_jianti_auto":"权","people_xingming":"郑权","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"c3426b94-db0e-11ef-810a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"宗奭","people_name_jianti_auto":"宗奭","people_xingming":"李宗奭","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"c3426b95-db0e-11ef-a8a2-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":761,"link_death_year":827,"link_td_description":"乌重胤，字保君，封张掖郡公，后进为邠国公，谥懿穆。唐朝将领、使相。","link_td_id":"Q10002585","link_td_number_id":1464819,"people_name":"烏重胤","people_name_jianti_auto":"乌重胤","people_xingming":"乌重胤","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"c3426b96-db0e-11ef-a8ef-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":824,"link_td_description":"郑权，字复道，荥阳开封人，唐朝中期的节度使。","link_td_id":"Q10017049","link_td_number_id":4544704,"people_name":"權","people_name_jianti_auto":"权","people_xingming":"郑权","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"c3426b97-db0e-11ef-a5f4-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"宗奭","people_name_jianti_auto":"宗奭","people_xingming":"李宗奭","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"c3426b98-db0e-11ef-ae49-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"宗奭","people_name_jianti_auto":"宗奭","people_xingming":"李宗奭","start_index":70,"tongjian_id":"c3426b99-db0e-11ef-8356-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"滄州","place_name_jianti_auto":"沧州","place_note":"河北省沧州市东南","resolved_place_entity_id":620,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"c3426b92-db0e-11ef-ae0c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"橫海","place_name_jianti_auto":"横海","place_note":"总部设沧州","resolved_place_entity_id":713,"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"c3426b93-db0e-11ef-be11-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京師","place_name_jianti_auto":"京师","resolved_place_entity_id":43,"start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"c3426b9a-db0e-11ef-8330-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政","人事"],"content":"6滄州刺史李宗奭與橫海節度使鄭權不叶，不受其節制；權奏之。上遣中使追之，宗奭使其軍中留己，表稱懼亂未敢離州。詔以烏重胤代權，將吏懼，逐宗奭，宗奭奔京師，辛丑，斬于獨柳之下。","content_fanyi":"沧州刺史李宗奭与横海节度使郑权不和，不肯接受郑权节制；郑权上奏朝廷。皇上派中使召他回朝，李宗奭让军中将士挽留自己，上表声称担心军中作乱，不敢离开沧州。朝廷下诏命乌重胤接替郑权，沧州将吏畏惧，便赶走李宗奭，李宗奭逃往京城，辛丑日，在独柳之下被斩首。","content_jianti_auto":"6沧州刺史李宗奭与横海节度使郑权不叶，不受其节制；权奏之。上遣中使追之，宗奭使其军中留己，表称惧乱未敢离州。诏以乌重胤代权，将吏惧，逐宗奭，宗奭奔京师，辛丑，斩于独柳之下。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":24353,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"c3426b86-db0e-11ef-a211-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":764,"link_death_year":821,"link_td_description":"田弘正，本名田兴，字安道，唐宪宗赐名弘正。唐平州卢龙（今河北卢龙）人。魏博节度使田承嗣的从侄，相州刺史田廷玠之子。唐宪宗时为魏博节度使，唐穆宗时以功高，升中书令。后改任成德节度使，被成德军兵马使王廷凑谋杀。赠太尉，谥忠愍。","link_td_id":"Q10001745","link_td_number_id":794539,"people_name":"田弘正","people_name_jianti_auto":"田弘正","people_xingming":"田弘正","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"c3426b9c-db0e-11ef-8248-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"平盧","place_name_jianti_auto":"平卢","resolved_place_entity_id":349,"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"c3426b9d-db0e-11ef-be80-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"陽穀","place_name_jianti_auto":"阳谷","resolved_place_entity_id":3474,"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"c3426b9e-db0e-11ef-b39e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/三、济宁州（卷三十三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"宋开宝八年，徙县治南穀镇。太平兴国二年，徙治利仁镇。绍兴...","context_before":"...阿县。元和二年，幸东阿。是也。隋、唐县皆治此。《唐史》：","source_end_index":234,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"bb403b0a-f384-50e4-9106-4dee85247b9a","source_start_index":202,"source_text":"元和十三年，魏博帅田弘正奉诏讨淄青，败其兵于东阿，又败之于阳穀。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/三、济宁州（卷三十三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"7丙午，田弘正奏敗平盧兵於陽穀。","content_fanyi":"丙午日，田弘正上奏报告，在阳谷打败了平卢的军队。","content_jianti_auto":"7丙午，田弘正奏败平卢兵于阳谷。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":24354,"number":7,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"c3426b9b-db0e-11ef-8511-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"十四年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"十四年","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"c34021bd-db0e-11ef-8999-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（己亥、八一九）","year_int":819},"message":"success","success":true}